-- The takanon's root (MMS-521): every takanon provision that speaks to an
-- item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), the instruments it
-- includes (each describes itself in its own file), and what each claims
-- for a case. It is a `collection root` (l4/lib/precedence.l4): the
-- takanon speaks once on an item, so its ruling is that provision. The root
-- (l4/lib/root.l4) sets it against the agreements' and the circulars'
-- rulings by the takanon's own introduction.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT `takanon-1-1`

§ `שורש התקנון — מה התקנון אומר על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- Each instrument describes itself in its own file (an `instrument` record
-- of the shared vocabulary). This root includes the takanon's provisions:
`the takanon's instruments` MEANS LIST `the takanon §1.1`

§§ `מה התקנון אומר, לפי פריט`

-- The date the takanon's provision on an item was last amended: the
-- takanon's introduction lets an owners' circular prevail only if it is
-- more recent.
GIVEN i IS A `pay item`
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the date the takanon's provision on it was last amended` i IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN `the takanon §1.1`'s `issued`
    -- no provision of the takanon in the root speaks to the other items, so
    -- the takanon makes no claim on them and the date is never weighed
    OTHERWISE DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1900

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the takanon's claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the takanon §1.1` (`the 2008 supplement according to the takanon` c))
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

§§ `הכרעת התקנון`

-- One provision of the takanon speaks to an item (its tests hold it to one):
-- the takanon's ruling is that provision's claim.
GIVEN claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH A MAYBE `ruling`
DECIDE `the takanon's ruling among` claims IS
    CONSIDER claims
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN t FOLLOWED BY ts THEN JUST (`the ruling for` t `the only instrument that speaks`)

`the takanon's root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה"
        `its instruments` IS `the takanon's instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the takanon's claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS (GIVEN i, c YIELD `the takanon's ruling among` (`the takanon's claims on` i c))
